ulative 90-day leaderboard.","format":0,"style":"","mode":"normal","detail":0,"version":1}]},{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"listitem","value":4,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"The leaderboard will reflect the cumulative scores of participants throughout the contest period.","format":0,"style":"","mode":"normal","detail":0,"version":1}]},{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"listitem","value":5,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"The participant with the highest cumulative score at the end of the 90-day contest will be declared the overall winner, subject to verification.","format":0,"style":"","mode":"normal","detail":0,"version":1}]},{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"listitem","value":6,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"Only valid scores recorded by the quiz platform during the contest period will be considered.","format":0,"style":"","mode":"normal","detail":0,"version":1}]},{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"listitem","value":7,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"The organisers reserve the right to review, verify or correct scores in the event of technical errors, suspected manipulation or discrepancies.","format":0,"style":"","mode":"normal","detail":0,"version":1}]}]},{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"heading","tag":"h3","children":[{"type":"text","text":"5. Grand Prize","format":0,"style":"","mode":"normal","detail":0,"version":1}]},{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"list","listType":"bullet","tag":"ul","start":1,"children":[{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"listitem","value":1,"children":[{"type":"text","text":"The participant who tops the final cumulative leaderboard at the end of the 90-day contest will win* an Apple Watch.","format":0,"style":"","mode":"normal","detail":0,"version":1}]},{"direction":"ltr","format":"","indent":0,"version":1,"type":"listitem","value"